                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I used to play this game all the time on my old PSP and glad to see it was ported to Steam! It's just as fun as I remember, a fairly simple, casual tower defense game with some neat mechanics here and there perhaps not seen in other tower defenses. It brings enough of a challenge to want to come back and keep playing, and I find the variety of enemies and gadgets to be pleasing. Overall, a great game that I'd recommend to anyone wanting a quick, fun tower defense.",
